# The one-argument call runs a Structure over itself and selects no `var` child (the book, call-receivers): the places
# Code declares in its var are not fields of Code itself, so the data lacks the variable the code uses -- answer 3. The
# var is passed explicitly: `call: Code Code\var`.
Code:
    var:
        int: x 1
    end: var
    x := x + 1
end: Code
call: Code
